VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT study-t07
GOAL
  Cancelling a booking works and stays inside the architecture.
CLAIM cancel-ok REQUIRED
  ENSURE cancelling an existing booking returns Ok and marks it cancelled
CLAIM cancel-missing REQUIRED
  ENSURE cancelling an unknown booking returns Err
INVARIANT layering CRITICAL
  ENSURE the service layer never touches the storage module directly
INVARIANT tests-green CRITICAL
  ENSURE all tests pass
VERIFY cancel-ok
  USING mini.t.cancel.ok
VERIFY cancel-missing
  USING mini.t.cancel.missing
VERIFY layering
  USING mini.layering
VERIFY tests-green
  USING mini.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
